## Frequently asked questions

**How much does website design in Cardiff cost?**
Prices vary depending on the size and complexity of your project. We offer transparent, upfront pricing — [get in touch](/contact/) for a free quote tailored to your needs.

**How long will my website take to build?**
Most Cardiff website projects are completed within three to five weeks, depending on content availability.

**Will my website rank on Google?**
Every website we build includes on-page SEO setup. For ongoing local search growth, we also offer a dedicated [local SEO service](/services/local-seo-google-ranking/).

**Do I own the website once it's built?**
Yes — you own everything outright. No lock-in, no proprietary systems.

**Can you redesign an existing Cardiff website?**
Absolutely. If your current site is outdated or underperforming, [get in touch](/contact/) and we'll talk you through your options.
